  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>{{collectionTitle}} · AFTERGLOW</title><style>\n:root{--ag-bg:{{background}};--ag-paper:{{paperColor}};--ag-ink:{{textColor}};--ag-accent:{{themeColor}};--ag-muted:#626d61;--ag-accent-text:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ag-accent) 75%,var(--ag-ink));--ag-line:#293b3429;--ag-serif:\"Iowan Old Style\",\"Palatino Linotype\",\"Songti SC\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",\"Source Han Serif SC\",SimSun,Georgia,serif;--ag-sans:Inter,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color-scheme:light}\n:root[data-ag-theme=night]{--ag-bg:#14201e;--ag-paper:#1e2c28;--ag-ink:#eee6d6;--ag-muted:#a7b4a6;--ag-line:#dedaca30;color-scheme:dark}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}[hidden]{display:none!important}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:32px}body{margin:0;background:var(--ag-bg);color:var(--ag-ink);font-family:var(--ag-serif);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}button,a{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}button{font-family:var(--ag-sans);color:inherit;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ag-accent);outline-offset:5px}button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.3}::selection{background:var(--ag-accent);color:#fff}img{display:block;max-width:100%}p{margin:0}a{color:inherit}button{border:0;background:none}h1,h2,h3{font-weight:400;margin:0}.ag-book{max-width:{{contentWidth}}px;margin:auto;padding:0 5.5%;position:relative}.ag-small{font:10px/1.6 var(--ag-sans);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.ag-accent{color:var(--ag-accent)}.ag-muted{color:var(--ag-muted)}\n.ag-mast{height:104px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ag-line);gap:20px}.ag-wordmark{font:26px/1 var(--ag-serif);letter-spacing:-1px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.ag-wordmark i{font-style:normal;color:var(--ag-accent);font-size:25px}.ag-mast-right{display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center}.ag-mast-right>span{font:10px var(--ag-sans);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--ag-muted)}.ag-index-open{min-width:44px;min-height:44px;font-size:11px;padding:12px 0;letter-spacing:.1em;display:none}.ag-enhanced .ag-index-open{display:block}.ag-index-open span{margin-left:10px;color:var(--ag-accent)}\n.ag-cover{min-height:750px;min-height:min(820px,calc(100svh - 104px));position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7%;align-items:center;padding:62px 0 64px}.ag-cover-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:8px 0}.ag-edition{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;margin-bottom:38px;color:var(--ag-muted)}.ag-edition:before{content:\"\";width:30px;height:1px;background:var(--ag-accent)}.ag-title{font-size:clamp(38px,5.6vw,78px);line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:.04em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-wrap:balance;max-width:6em}.ag-title.ag-long{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,56px);line-height:1.45;max-width:11em}.ag-subtitle{margin-top:24px;font:italic clamp(24px,2.4vw,35px)/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:var(--ag-accent)}.ag-synopsis{font-size:14px;line-height:2.15;color:var(--ag-muted);max-width:30em;margin-top:32px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-line}.ag-cover-signature{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;margin-top:32px;padding-top:23px;border-top:1px solid var(--ag-line);max-width:330px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ag-cover-signature strong{font-size:13px;font-weight:400;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ag-read{display:none;align-items:center;gap:34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ag-accent);padding:12px 0;margin-top:29px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em}.ag-enhanced .ag-read{display:inline-flex}.ag-read span{font-size:20px;color:var(--ag-accent);transition:transform .25s}.ag-read:hover span{transform:translateY(3px)}\n.ag-cover-visual{width:min(100%,max(260px,calc((100svh - 285px)*.8)));justify-self:end;position:relative;padding:0 0 28px 18px;align-self:center}.ag-cover-orbit{position:absolute;inset:-18px 18px 10px -4px;border:1px solid var(--ag-line);border-radius:48% 48% 0 0;pointer-events:none}.ag-cover-mount{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;border-radius:48% 48% 0 0;background:var(--ag-paper);isolation:isolate;box-shadow:0 22px 52px -34px #283b3444}.ag-cover-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 45%;transform:translateY(var(--ag-drift,0px)) scale(1.065)}.ag-cover-mount:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 65%,#14201e40);pointer-events:none}.ag-cover-annotation{position:absolute;right:-16px;top:20%;writing-mode:vertical-rl;font:9px var(--ag-sans);letter-spacing:.23em;color:var(--ag-muted)}.ag-art-number{position:absolute;bottom:49px;left:-15px;font:italic clamp(74px,9vw,135px)/.8 Georgia,serif;color:var(--ag-bg);text-shadow:1px 0 var(--ag-accent),-1px 0 var(--ag-accent),0 1px var(--ag-accent),0 -1px var(--ag-accent);z-index:3;pointer-events:none}.ag-cover-note{margin-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:var(--ag-muted);font:9px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);letter-spacing:.1em}.ag-cover-note span:last-child{white-space:nowrap}.ag-cover-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--ag-line);padding:19px 0 24px;color:var(--ag-muted)}\n.ag-chapter-head{width:min(100%,840px);margin:40px auto 24px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;color:var(--ag-muted)}.ag-chapter-head h2{font:14px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);flex:none}.ag-chapter-head span{font:11px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);text-align:right;max-width:75%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ag-cover-note>span:first-child{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.ag-pages{padding:0}.ag-frame{position:relative;width:min(100%,var(--ag-native-width,840px),840px);margin:0 auto 44px;padding:0;display:block}.ag-visual{position:relative;min-width:0}.ag-frame-art{position:relative;border:{{frameBorder}}px solid var(--ag-accent);display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:transparent;box-shadow:0 2px 10px #17282009}.ag-image{width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:none;border-radius:{{imageRadius}}px}.ag-image[data-ag-zoom]{cursor:zoom-in}.ag-caption{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:7px 22px;padding:13px 0 0;min-width:0}.ag-caption-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:11px;min-width:0}.ag-frame-label{flex:none;font:11px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);color:var(--ag-accent-text);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ag-frame-name{font:17px/1.65 var(--ag-serif);overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0}.ag-view{display:none;align-self:start;font:11px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);color:var(--ag-muted);padding:0;min-height:32px;margin-top:-2px;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}.ag-enhanced .ag-view{display:block}.ag-view:hover{color:var(--ag-ink)}.ag-caption-text{grid-column:1/-1;font:13px/1.9 var(--ag-sans);color:var(--ag-muted);margin:0;max-width:68ch;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ag-caption-text:empty{display:none}.ag-prompt{grid-column:1/-1;font:11px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);color:var(--ag-muted);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:8px 0 0;max-height:180px;overflow:auto}.ag-image-note{display:block;color:var(--ag-muted);font:12px/1.8 var(--ag-sans);margin-top:8px}.ag-image-note:empty{display:none}.ag-frame[data-ag-shape=small]{width:min(100%,max(var(--ag-native-width,320px),320px))}.ag-frame[data-ag-shape=small] .ag-frame-art{padding:16px 0;box-shadow:none;background:var(--ag-paper)}.ag-frame[data-ag-shape=missing] .ag-frame-art{min-height:180px;background:var(--ag-paper);box-shadow:none}.ag-frame[data-ag-shape=missing] .ag-view{display:none}\n.ag-ending{position:relative;margin:36px 0 0;padding:95px 0 40px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--ag-line)}.ag-ending-mark{font-size:25px;color:var(--ag-accent);margin-bottom:31px}.ag-ending h2{font:italic clamp(45px,7.8vw,108px)/1.05 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ag-ending h2 span{color:var(--ag-accent)}.ag-ending-copy{font-size:13px;line-height:2.1;color:var(--ag-muted);margin:30px 0 32px;letter-spacing:.1em}.ag-signature{font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ag-imprint{margin-top:54px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--ag-line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;color:var(--ag-muted)}.ag-ending .mio-colophon{margin-top:25px;color:var(--ag-muted);padding-bottom:15px}.ag-book+.ag-book{margin-top:80px}.ag-reading-line{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:2px;background:var(--ag-accent);transform:scaleX(var(--ag-progress,0));transform-origin:left;z-index:20;pointer-events:none}\n.ag-dock{position:fixed;bottom:22px;right:24px;z-index:18;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;padding:5px;border:1px solid var(--ag-line);border-radius:40px;background:var(--ag-paper);box-shadow:0 6px 30px #13231b12;font:10px var(--ag-sans);color:var(--ag-ink)}.ag-dock button{min-width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:24px;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap}.ag-dock button:hover{background:var(--ag-bg)}.ag-position{padding:0 12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ag-muted);border-right:1px solid var(--ag-line)}.ag-dialog{width:min(700px,calc(100vw - 30px));max-width:calc(100vw - 30px);max-height:85dvh;margin:auto;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--ag-line);border-radius:4px;background:var(--ag-paper);color:var(--ag-ink);box-shadow:0 25px 100px #0004}.ag-dialog::backdrop{background:#10201be0;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}.ag-dialog-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:22px 25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ag-line)}.ag-dialog-head h2{font-size:23px}.ag-close{padding:9px 12px;font-size:19px;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;flex:none}.ag-zoom-label{font:11px/1.6 var(--ag-sans)!important;overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0}.ag-contents-list{max-height:60dvh;overflow:auto;padding:10px 22px 25px}.ag-contents-item{display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;gap:17px;text-align:left;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ag-line)}.ag-contents-item img{width:52px;height:62px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--ag-bg);flex:none}.ag-contents-item span{font:10px var(--ag-sans);color:var(--ag-accent-text)}.ag-contents-item strong{font:15px/1.7 var(--ag-serif);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ag-contents-item:hover strong{color:var(--ag-accent)}.ag-lightbox{width:100vw;max-width:100vw;height:100dvh;max-height:100dvh;border:0;background:#101918;color:#eee9db;border-radius:0}.ag-lightbox[open]{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.ag-lightbox .ag-dialog-head{padding:10px 22px;border-color:#ffffff20;flex:none;font:11px var(--ag-sans)}.ag-light-stage{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.ag-light-stage img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;width:auto;height:auto;object-fit:contain}.ag-light-stage.ag-actual{display:block}.ag-light-stage.ag-actual img{max-width:none;max-height:none;margin:auto}.ag-light-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:22px;padding:16px;flex:none;font:11px var(--ag-sans);border-top:1px solid #ffffff20}.ag-light-controls button{padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #ffffff35;border-radius:30px}.ag-light-controls button:hover{background:#ffffff10}\n@media(min-width:1500px){.ag-title{font-size:78px}}\n@media(max-width:1000px){.ag-book{padding:0 5%}.ag-cover{gap:6%;padding:55px 0;min-height:680px}.ag-title{font-size:clamp(34px,5.5vw,60px)}.ag-edition{margin-bottom:25px}.ag-synopsis{font-size:12px;margin-top:24px}.ag-cover-signature{margin-top:24px}.ag-cover-annotation{right:-12px;font-size:8px}}\n@media(max-width:650px){.ag-book{padding:0 6%}.ag-mast{height:78px}.ag-wordmark{font-size:24px}.ag-mast-right>span{display:none}.ag-cover{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:38px 0 25px;gap:40px;min-height:0}.ag-cover-copy{padding:0}.ag-edition{font-size:8px;margin-bottom:25px}.ag-title,.ag-title.ag-long{font-size:clamp(32px,9vw,47px);line-height:1.45;max-width:none;letter-spacing:.06em}.ag-subtitle{font-size:27px;margin-top:14px}.ag-synopsis{font-size:12px;margin-top:22px;max-width:34em}.ag-cover-signature{font-size:10px;padding-top:17px;margin-top:21px;max-width:none}.ag-cover-signature strong{font-size:12px}.ag-read{margin-top:18px;padding:9px 0}.ag-cover-visual{width:86%;margin:0 auto 0;padding:0 0 22px 10px}.ag-cover-orbit{inset:-12px 12px 8px -4px}.ag-art-number{font-size:85px;left:-20px;bottom:40px}.ag-cover-annotation{font-size:8px;right:-21px}.ag-cover-note{font-size:8px;gap:10px}.ag-cover-bottom{font-size:8px;padding:16px 0}.ag-pages{margin-inline:-10px}.ag-chapter-head{width:auto;margin:28px -10px 20px}.ag-chapter-head h2{font-size:13px}.ag-chapter-head span{font-size:10px}.ag-frame{margin-bottom:32px}.ag-caption{gap:5px 12px;padding:10px 2px 0}.ag-caption-head{gap:8px}.ag-frame-name{font-size:15px}.ag-frame-label{font-size:10px}.ag-caption-text{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9}.ag-view{font-size:10px;margin-top:-6px}.ag-frame[data-ag-shape=small] .ag-frame-art{padding:12px 0}.ag-ending{padding:58px 0 90px;margin-top:15px}.ag-ending h2{font-size:clamp(44px,14vw,66px)}.ag-ending-copy{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.03em}.ag-imprint{font-size:8px;margin-top:38px}.ag-ending .mio-colophon{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.01em;padding-inline:0}.ag-dock{bottom:12px;right:12px}.ag-dock button{padding:10px;font-size:9px}.ag-position{font-size:9px;padding:0 9px}.ag-dialog-head{padding:17px}.ag-contents-list{padding:4px 17px 20px}.ag-view{min-height:44px!important}.ag-light-stage{padding:12px}.ag-light-controls{gap:12px;padding:12px}.ag-light-controls button{font-size:10px;padding:9px 12px}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.ag-cover-img{transform:none!important}}\n@media print{:root,:root[data-ag-theme=night]{--ag-bg:#fff;--ag-paper:#fff;--ag-ink:#222;--ag-muted:#555;--ag-line:#0003;color-scheme:light}html{scroll-behavior:auto}body{background:#fff;color:#222}.ag-book{max-width:none;padding:0}.ag-mast{height:65px}.ag-cover{min-height:0;break-after:page;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:30px 0}.ag-title{font-size:36px}.ag-cover-visual{width:100%}.ag-frame{break-inside:avoid;padding:25px 0}.ag-image{max-height:230mm!important;object-fit:contain}.ag-frame-art{box-shadow:none}.ag-dock,.ag-reading-line,.ag-view,.ag-read,.ag-index-open,.ag-dialog{display:none!important}.ag-ending{break-inside:avoid;padding:30px 0}.ag-ending h2{font-size:50px}.ag-cover-img{transform:none!important}.ag-caption-text,.ag-ending-copy{color:#555}.ag-book+.ag-book{break-before:page}.ag-book,.ag-frame,.ag-cover{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}}\n</style></head><body data-mio-afterglow>\n{{#books}}<article class=\"ag-book\" data-cc-book>\n<header class=\"ag-mast\"><div class=\"ag-wordmark\"><i>✳</i> Afterglow.</div><div class=\"ag-mast-right\"><span>A MIO PRIVATE EDITION</span><button class=\"ag-index-open\" type=\"button\" data-ag-index-open>目次 <span>☷</span></button></div></header>\n<section class=\"ag-cover\"><div class=\"ag-cover-copy\"><div class=\"ag-edition ag-small\">A STORY TOLD IN {{panelCount}} FRAMES</div><h1 class=\"ag-title\">{{title}}</h1><p class=\"ag-subtitle\">Where the light lingers.</p><p class=\"ag-synopsis\">{{synopsis}}</p><div class=\"ag-cover-signature\"><span class=\"ag-small ag-muted\">STORY &amp; ART</span><strong>{{signature}}</strong></div><button class=\"ag-read\" type=\"button\" data-ag-read>翻开这本画册 <span>↓</span></button></div><div class=\"ag-cover-visual\"><div class=\"ag-cover-orbit\"></div><div class=\"ag-cover-mount\"><img class=\"ag-cover-img\" src=\"{{coverImage}}\" alt=\"{{title}} · 封面取景\" decoding=\"async\"></div><span class=\"ag-cover-annotation\">COLLECTING MOMENTS, KEEPING LIGHT</span><span class=\"ag-art-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><div class=\"ag-cover-note\"><span>{{characterName}}</span><span>PLATE 001 / COVER</span></div></div></section>\n<div class=\"ag-cover-bottom ag-small\"><span>余光 / 一册被时光照亮的故事</span><span>{{date}}</span></div>\n<div class=\"ag-chapter-head\"><h2>正文</h2><span>{{panelCount}} 幕 · {{storyTitle}}</span></div>\n<main class=\"ag-pages\" data-cc-pages>{{#frames}}\n<figure class=\"ag-frame\" data-cc-frame><div class=\"ag-visual\"><div class=\"ag-frame-art\"><img class=\"ag-image\" src=\"{{image}}\" alt=\"{{name}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><small class=\"ag-image-note\">{{imageNote}}</small></div><figcaption class=\"ag-caption\"><div class=\"ag-caption-head\"><span class=\"ag-frame-label\" aria-label=\"分镜 {{number}}\">{{number}}</span><h2 class=\"ag-frame-name\">{{name}}</h2></div><button class=\"ag-view\" type=\"button\" data-ag-view aria-label=\"放大查看 {{name}}\">看原图 ↗</button><p class=\"ag-caption-text\" data-cc-caption>{{caption}}</p><pre class=\"ag-prompt\" data-cc-prompt>{{prompt}}</pre></figcaption></figure>\n{{/frames}}</main>\n<footer class=\"ag-ending edition-end\"><div class=\"ag-ending-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✳</div><span class=\"ag-small ag-muted\">THE LAST PAGE, NOT THE LAST LIGHT</span><h2>The light<br><span>stays.</span></h2><p class=\"ag-ending-copy\">故事暂时停在这里。<br>而那些被看见的瞬间，会继续发光。</p><div class=\"ag-signature\">{{signature}}</div><div class=\"ag-imprint ag-small\"><span>AFTERGLOW / MIO</span><span>{{panelCount}} FRAMES · {{date}}</span></div></footer>\n</article>{{/books}}</body></html>",
